<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-US">

<!-- @pageTitle = Sillydelphia Film Festival -->

<!-- @include "global/head.kit"-->

<body class="project-page">
    <!-- @include "global/header_nav.kit" -->

    <main>
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="title-frame margins">
                <h1 class="project-title puzzle-type puzzle-auto" data-vertical-align="bottom">Sillydelphia</h1>
                <h5 class="desc">The next generation of filmmakers</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="vimeo-video hero-image" id="L1" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/sil1.jpg');padding:61.67% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe 
                    src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1199239205?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0&min_quality=720p" 
                    frameborder="0" 
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;" 
                    title="sil1_bumper-hero">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <div class="tags-frame margins">
                <div class="tag">
                    <p>Logo</p>
                    <div class="squares"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="tag">
                    <p>Strategy</p>
                    <div class="squares"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="tag">
                    <p>Identity</p>
                    <div class="squares"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="adjectives margins">
                <p>CLEVER</p>
                <p>EAGER</p>
                <p>FRIENDLY</p>
                <p>BODGED</p>
                <p>LIGHT-HEARTED</p>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="intro margins">
            <h5>
                Sillydelphia Film Festival is a student-run film festival to celebrate undergrad and grad works from across the country. The goal is to create a hub for creative youngsters and bring in the next generation of&nbsp;filmmakers.
            </h5>
        </section>
        <section class="content margins" id="window">
            <img src="assets/project-pages/sil2_logo-banner.jpg" alt="Logo banner" class="width6" id="sil2">
          
            <div class="small-img width3">
                <div class="vimeo-video" id="sil3" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/sil3.jpg');padding:100% 0 0 0;">
                    <iframe 
                        src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1199239206?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0&min_quality=720p" 
                        frameborder="0" 
                        allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;" 
                        title="sil3_logo-variants">
                    </iframe>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p class="width3">
                Vlad and Patrick were opening up Sillydelphia’s second edition from strictly comedies to films of all genres. We helped them position themselves with a jaunty brand voice, confident visual identity, and energetic motion&nbsp;system.
            </p>

            <div class="width2"> </div> <!-- Filler Div-->

            <div class="vimeo-video width4" id="sil4" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/sil4.jpg');padding:73.87% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe 
                    src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1199239211?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0&min_quality=720p" 
                    frameborder="0" 
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;" 
                    title="sil4_movie-clips-placeholder">
                </iframe>
            </div>

            <div class="vimeo-video width3" id="sil5" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/sil5.jpg');padding:135.37% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe 
                    src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1199239207?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0&min_quality=720p" 
                    frameborder="0" 
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;" 
                    title="sil5_button-hover">
                </iframe>
            </div>

            <img src="assets/project-pages/sil6_postcard.jpg" alt="Postcard" class="width3 align-bottom" id="sil6">

            <p class="width6 narrow-text">
                The copywriting is a fun nod to how college students speak to each other, making it feel relatable and accessible. The proudly playful spirit of the copy informs the playful placement, allowing us to angle, repeat, and throw type all around a&nbsp;composition.
            </p>
            
            <div class="vimeo-video width6" id="sil7" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/sil7.jpg');padding:48.48% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe 
                    src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1199239218?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0&min_quality=720p" 
                    frameborder="0" 
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;" 
                    title="sil7_typeface-breakdown">
                </iframe>
            </div>

            <img src="assets/project-pages/sil8_fence-billboard.jpg" alt="Fence billboard" class="width6" id="sil8">

            <img src="assets/project-pages/sil9_website-design.jpg" alt="Website design" class="width4" id="sil9">

            <p class="width2 align-top-left">
                Sillydelphia is for the students who are obsessed with film but don’t always get the opportunity to share it. The filmstrip-inspired graphic elements visually connect the festival to motion picture history and broaden the scope from just comedy to a larger film&nbsp;audience.
            </p>

            <div class="small-img width3">
                <div class="vimeo-video" id="sil10" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/sil10.jpg');padding:100% 0 0 0;">
                    <iframe 
                        src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1199239226?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0&min_quality=720p" 
                        frameborder="0" 
                        allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;" 
                        title="sil10_badge-morphing">
                    </iframe>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="vimeo-video width3" id="sil11" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/sil11.jpg');padding:135.37% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe 
                    src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1199239227?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0&min_quality=720p" 
                    frameborder="0" 
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;" 
                    title="sil11_digital-poster-series">
                </iframe>
            </div>

            <div class="vimeo-video width6" id="sil12" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/sil12.jpg');padding:48.48% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe 
                    src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1199239231?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0&min_quality=720p" 
                    frameborder="0" 
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;" 
                    title="sil12_strip-bumper">
                </iframe>
            </div>

            <img src="assets/project-pages/sil13_wayfinding.jpg" alt="Wayfinding" class="width4" id="sil13">
            
            <img src="assets/project-pages/sil14_strip-type.jpg" alt="Strip type" class="width2" id="sil14">

            <div class="vimeo-video width6" id="sil15" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/sil15.jpg');padding:48.48% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe 
                    src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1199239233?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0&min_quality=720p" 
                    frameborder="0" 
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;" 
                    title="sil15_icon-breakdown">
                </iframe>
            </div>

            <p class="width6 narrow-text">
                We developed a vibrant color palette and an icon library that introduces a medley of new shapes. The beveled corners visually tie to the beveled shape of the logo and&nbsp;strips.
            </p>

            <div class="vimeo-video width6" id="sil16" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/sil16.jpg');padding:48.48% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe 
                    src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1199239242?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0&min_quality=720p" 
                    frameborder="0" 
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;" 
                    title="sil16_icons-bumper">
                </iframe>
            </div>

            <div class="width3"> </div> <!-- Filler Div-->

            <img src="assets/project-pages/sil17_totebag.jpg" alt="Tote bag" class="width3" id="sil17">

            <div class="vimeo-video width4" id="sil18" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/sil18.jpg');padding:73.87% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe 
                    src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1199239244?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0&min_quality=720p" 
                    frameborder="0" 
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;" 
                    title="sil18_smorgasbord-anim">
                </iframe>
            </div>

            <p class="width2">
                Sillydelphia is a stepping stone for students to get work screened, connect with professionals, and get inspired to collab with peers. Celebrating the low-budget wins, the long-night efforts, and the beloved memories of putting a movie together with your&nbsp;friends.
            </p>

            <img src="assets/project-pages/sil19_brand-overview.jpg" alt="Brand overview" class="width6" id="sil19">
        </section>
        <!-- @include "global/components/next-project.kit" -->

        <!-- @include "global/footer.kit" -->


    </main>
    <!-- @import "global/scripts.kit"-->

</body>

</html>